              </div>
            

     </dl>

    </div>]]><![CDATA[<p>A company making virtual instruments organised a competition where they made available a ~70 second long video without audio and asked people to re-score it. The video is a trailer for one of their sample libraries and the original version (with the original audio) is <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JJQ__r2mQ6c">here</a>.</p>
<p>I had a lot of fun working on my version of the score! I&rsquo;m super happy with how the foley glass/paper sounds at <a href="https://youtu.be/sCefagjPG4M?feature=shared&amp;t=13">00:13</a> turned out and also how the &ldquo;hopeful&rdquo; part at <a href="https://youtu.be/sCefagjPG4M?feature=shared&amp;t=25">00:25</a> transitions into creepy.</p>
]]></content:encoded></item><item><title>Alone</title><link>https://tlocrt.com/music/alone/</link><guid>https://tlocrt.com/music/alone/</guid><pubDate>
