Sun, 01 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>
A website for Bitesized, created in Hugo.</description><content:encoded><![CDATA[

      

          

            

                  

                  
                  
                      
                  

                  
                      
                  
                      
                          
                      
                  


                  


                  <a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/web/bitesized_website/images/bitesized_website_v01.png">
                    <img class="work-image"
                         src="https://tlocrt.com/other/web/bitesized_website/images/bitesized_website_v01_hu9878913375542596661.png"
                         alt="bitesized website image"
                         loading="lazy">
                  </a>


          

      



        <div class="work-details">

<dl>
          
            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Title:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value">Bitesized Website</span> </dd>
              </div>
            
        


            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Description:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> A website for Bitesized, created in Hugo. </span> </dd>
              </div>
            




            

            

            

            

            



            

            

            



            

            



            

            



            

            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">URL:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> <a href="https://bitesizedband.com/">https://bitesizedband.com/</a> </span> </dd>
              </div>
            




            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Date:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> September 2024 </span> </dd>
              </div>
            

     </dl>

    </div>]]><![CDATA[<p>I created another website, this time for Bitesized. This one was considerably less work than the <a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/web/tlocrt_website/">tlocrt website</a>, as I could reuse the theme I had already built.</p>
<p>Since most of the Bitesized cover art is greyscale, I went with a simple greyscale look.</p>
<p>Bitesized is a DIY band. I tried conveying this by using a handwritten font in the headers and by incorporating custom handwritten letters in the logo.</p>
<p>Website features include:</p>
<ul>
<li>a rectangle animation when a user hovers over links</li>
<li>social media icons</li>
<li>a scaling animation when a user hovers over social media icons</li>
</ul>
<p>One of my favourite parts is how the simplified logo in the favicon turned out.</p>


  























<a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/web/bitesized_website/images/bitesized_website_favicon_hu11795942459930596934.png">
    <img class="md-image"
         src="https://tlocrt.com/other/web/bitesized_website/images/bitesized_website_favicon_hu11795942459930596934.png"
         alt=""
         loading="lazy">
</a>


]]></content:encoded></item><item><title>Life of a Plant</title><link>https://tlocrt.com/visual/art/life_of_a_plant/</link><guid>https://tlocrt.com/visual/art/life_of_a_plant/</guid><pubDate>
