She wanted a tank top with longer sides, similar to one she already has.</p>
<p>The most challenging part of this project was the bottom hem. Since the sides are longer, the bottom edges were not perpendicular to the side seam and I had to improvise sewing those corners. I guess they turned out okay given my (lack of) XP.</p>


  

























